<title>INDIA: India ITC 96/97 1st half result on Nov 25.</title>
<headline>India ITC 96/97 1st half result on Nov 25.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest tobacco firm ITC Ltd on Wednesday told the Bombay Stock Exchange it would release its results for the six months to September 30, 1996 on November 25.</p>
<p>ITC is 31.7 percent owned by BAT Industries Plc of the U.K.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
